    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157-a1">

                <pb facs="0322" n="206" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg206"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Diplomatic Circular No. 15.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">surplus claims funds</hi>.</p>
                <p>With reference to Circular No. 194 of December 29th last, regarding the disposal
                    of the surplus revolutionary claims fund, the Dean has the honour to inform his
                    honourable colleagues that all the heads of missions have now assented <pb
                        facs="0323" n="207" xml:id="pg207"/> to the proposal contained in the Wai
                    Chiao Pu’s note of December 28th last, and he accordingly submits herewith for
                    their approval the draft of ‘a reply communicating this assent to the Chinese
                    Government.</p>
                <p>Circular No. 194 is annexed hereto for convenience of reference, together with
                    the letter from his excellency the Minister for Japan notifying his decision on
                    the subject in question.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
